{"meta":{"id":"tt26351137","type":"series","name":"Secretos de los pingüinos","imdb_id":"tt26351137","description":"Durante dos años extraordinarios, el explorador de National Geographic Bertie Gregory descubrió tradiciones secretas, inteligencia sorprendente y sociedades unidas de pingüinos nunca antes filmadas. Esta asombrosa serie nos revela que se parecen más a nosotros de lo que imaginábamos, desde amistades fuertes hasta valientes que se atreven a correr riesgos y usan el ingenio y la innovación en algunos de los lugares más extremos del mundo.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt26351137.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jLeoe0fbELybpOpMETiWNpdccoG.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vH2Cpg6xd0z7gXRGK9rwgr79xTz.png","genres":["Documental"],"releaseInfo":"2025","released":"2025-04-20T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Ended","imdbRating":"7.9","country":"United States of America, United Kingdom","cast":["Blake Lively","Bertie Gregory"],"director":["Ashley Lorenzo-Feldman"],"writer":["Bertie Gregory","Serena Davies","Andy Mitchell"],"trailers":[{"source":"QrdVfeHDYvA","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer","ytId":"QrdVfeHDYvA","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"QrdVfeHDYvA","title":"Official Trailer"}],"links":[{"name":"7.9","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt26351137"},{"name":"Documental","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Documental"},{"name":"Blake Lively","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Blake%20Lively"},{"name":"Bertie Gregory","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Bertie%20Gregory"},{"name":"Ashley Lorenzo-Feldman","category":"Directors","url":"stremio:///search?search=Ashley%20Lorenzo-Feldman"},{"name":"Bertie Gregory","category":"Writers","url":"stremio:///search?search=Bertie%20Gregory"},{"name":"Serena Davies","category":"Writers","url":"stremio:/